      "title": "Falco bridge: Add support for plugin data offsets",
      "message": "Falco bridge: Add support for plugin data offsets\n\nFor libs 0.21.0 and later, try to extract offsets for plugin fields. Use\nthem to set our offsets and mark generated items.\n\nFixes #20449\n",
